<BaseLayout
  title="SAS: Learning the Order of Thought in Diffusion LMs | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="Masked diffusion models have a hidden degree of freedom — the order in which tokens are unmasked. SAS learns a lightweight policy that optimizes this order, boosting Sudoku accuracy from 82% to 91.8% and GSM8K from 64% to 76%."
