<div class="section-no">05 — Order of Thought: Interactive Canvas</div>
<h2>Watch different schedules decode a Sudoku</h2>
<p>
  Sudoku makes the "order of thought" tangible. A 9×9 board has 51 blank cells that must be filled — and the order in which a masked diffusion model fills them determines whether it succeeds. Below is the same puzzle decoded under four different strategies. Light blue cells are revealed early (the model commits first); dark purple cells come last.
</p>

<div class="vp">
